{
  "file_id": "3614",
  "text_count": 101,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Let's go, guys.",
      "_offset": 1913,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 1937,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "All right!",
      "_offset": 1943,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Wait, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 1954,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "What is it, Hikari?",
      "_offset": 1968,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "I want to make a grave for\nPiccolomon before we leave the\nforest.",
      "_offset": 1988,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "I wasn't in the position to make a\nproper one for him at the time...",
      "_offset": 2054,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "You're right...",
      "_offset": 2123,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'll help!",
      "_offset": 2139,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Me, too!",
      "_offset": 2150,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Me, too!",
      "_offset": 2159,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "All right! Let's all get a bunch\nof flowers!",
      "_offset": 2168,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Can we, Taichi?",
      "_offset": 2213,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Of course!",
      "_offset": 2229,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Thanks.",
      "_offset": 2240,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "All right. Sora, you go with\nKoushirou. Hikari will come with\nme.",
      "_offset": 2248,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Got it. Let's go, Koushirou.",
      "_offset": 2314,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 2343,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 2348,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2358,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Hey, Taichi...",
      "_offset": 2364,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "What?",
      "_offset": 2379,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "What kind of Digimon was\nPiccolomon?",
      "_offset": 2385,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Well... when he first met us, he\ngot angry all of a sudden.",
      "_offset": 2422,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "When I couldn't get Agumon to\nevolve, he got me to take back\nwhat I'd lost...",
      "_offset": 2482,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Huh, so he was like a teacher to\nyou guys?",
      "_offset": 2560,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Yeah, he was looking after us.",
      "_offset": 2603,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Obtained a flower!",
      "_offset": 2634,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Obtained a flower!",
      "_offset": 2653,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Just one left, pi!",
      "_offset": 2672,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Obtained a flower!",
      "_offset": 2691,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "All right, let's meet up with the\nothers.",
      "_offset": 2710,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Koushirou! Sora! You look like\nyou're ready.",
      "_offset": 2752,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "So do you!",
      "_offset": 2797,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "We found food, so we brought some.",
      "_offset": 2808,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "There wasn't any time for\nPiccolomon to teach me anything...",
      "_offset": 2843,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "But since I'm with Taichi, I'll\nhave to do my best!",
      "_offset": 2904,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Food! Fooooooooood!",
      "_offset": 2956,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "That's...",
      "_offset": 2976,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "...Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 2986,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Food! Fooooooooood!",
      "_offset": 3002,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "He's succumbed to hunger!",
      "_offset": 3022,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Tailmon! Give me a hand!",
      "_offset": 3048,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Yeah! Now calm down!",
      "_offset": 3073,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Looks like he's calmed down.",
      "_offset": 3094,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "I kinda feel bad for him.",
      "_offset": 3123,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "...You!",
      "_offset": 3149,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Remember us? You're the one who\ngave us all that trouble at the\nrestaurant!",
      "_offset": 3157,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Aren't you hungry? Now eat!",
      "_offset": 3233,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "...Is this okay?",
      "_offset": 3261,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "It's fine. I'm sure that's what\nPiccolomon would say.",
      "_offset": 3278,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3332,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Did they get Piccolomon, too?",
      "_offset": 3338,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Yeah, he took a hit for us...",
      "_offset": 3368,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Are you guys gonna fight the Dark\nMasters?",
      "_offset": 3398,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Wouldn't it be in your best\ninterests to forget it?",
      "_offset": 3441,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "A lot of Digimon have sacrificed\nthemselves for us.",
      "_offset": 3493,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "We're fighting so that their\nsacrifices won't be in vain.",
      "_offset": 3545,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3603,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "What they said!",
      "_offset": 3609,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "And I'm going to protect Hikari.",
      "_offset": 3625,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Well, I'm not gonna need this.\nGimme a sec.",
      "_offset": 3658,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Thanks, Digitamamon!",
      "_offset": 3702,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "I can't help you, but good luck.",
      "_offset": 3723,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 3756,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "If we lost, Piccolomon would get\nmad at us...",
      "_offset": 3762,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "What kind of flowers would be\nappropriate?",
      "_offset": 3808,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "It's the thought that counts.",
      "_offset": 3851,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Why don't you look it up on the web?",
      "_offset": 3881,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "I'm sure Piccolomon would be happy\nno matter what...",
      "_offset": 3918,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "You're right.",
      "_offset": 3971,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3985,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "I can't use the Internet here,\nthough...",
      "_offset": 3991,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Oh, right...",
      "_offset": 4032,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "I'm sorry you had to get caught up\nin all this fighting, Hikari.",
      "_offset": 4045,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "I don't think of it as \"caught up\".",
      "_offset": 4110,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "If Taichi'll fight, then I will too.",
      "_offset": 4146,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "I came here because I wanted to.",
      "_offset": 4183,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "So don't be sorry, Sora.",
      "_offset": 4216,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Hikari...",
      "_offset": 4241,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "So I won't run away...",
      "_offset": 4251,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "I'm really sorry, Hikari...",
      "_offset": 4274,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Sora...",
      "_offset": 4302,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "It's surprisingly hard to gather\nflowers...",
      "_offset": 4310,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "You can do it, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 4354,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "That reminds me of something\nPiccolomon said...",
      "_offset": 4377,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "\"You lack exertion and guts, pi!\"",
      "_offset": 4425,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "What's that?",
      "_offset": 4459,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "You can do it, Taichi, pi!",
      "_offset": 4472,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "It was like Piccolomon's\ncatchphrase.",
      "_offset": 4499,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "But it doesn't really suit you.",
      "_offset": 4537,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 4569,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 4577,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Don't copy him!",
      "_offset": 4585,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Heehee!",
      "_offset": 4601,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "...Ah, I'm sorry.",
      "_offset": 4609,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "I remember when Yamato and I went\nto go look for our Crests...",
      "_offset": 4627,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "Oh yeah, that was the same day we\nmet Piccolomon.",
      "_offset": 4690,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Yes... I think Piccolomon's death\nmust have been a great shock to\nYamato.",
      "_offset": 4740,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "It's not a good idea to be\ncontinually reflecting on this,\nbut...",
      "_offset": 4814,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Hikari, it's okay to say you're in\npain if you really do feel that\nway.",
      "_offset": 4880,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}